    "obs_and_metrics": [],
    "innovation": "This paper presents a high-resolution ice core record of methane's carbon isotopes, revealing that during the last glacial termination, biomass burning emissions remained roughly constant while boreal wetland emissions were highly sensitive to climate, essentially shutting down during cold periods.",
